Import Pixtral's rotary embedding under the name the installed transformers uses.
Transformers 5.17 renamed PixtralRotaryEmbedding to PixtralVisionRotaryEmbedding
and switched it to axial RoPE over 2D (row, col) positions. The fork imports the
old name unconditionally, so every Pixtral-based model (Mistral Small 4) fails at
import on the nightly's transformers 5.18: ImportError: cannot import name
'PixtralRotaryEmbedding'. The guarded import and position helper are upstream's
pixtral.py hunk of https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56108 (commit
ec4a3a5370), unchanged. Drop once the nightly carries it.

